        "content": "## Chat Trigger & Semantic Cache Lookup\n\nCaptures incoming user queries from interactive chat or webhook, computes query embeddings with local Ollama, and queries the Pinecone semantic cache (`rag-semantic-cache`) with Top-K=1."
