      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 512,
        "content": "## Cold-Start & Cache Troubleshooting\n\nIf your Semantic Cache is empty or not returning hits on first setup, follow these steps to seed the initial cache:\n\n1. **Bypass Cache Lookup**: Temporarily connect **On Chat Message Received** directly to **AI Query Response Agent**.\n2. **Run a Test Query**: Submit one test question in the chat (e.g., *\"what is the accuracy of my neural network from scratch\"*).\n3. **Seed Initial Vector Entry**: Let the execution pass through the AI Agent so it generates the response and writes the first entry into Pinecone Semantic Cache (**Store Answer in Semantic Cache**).\n4. **Restore Full Pipeline Wiring**: Reconnect the full pipeline: **On Chat Message Received** → **Lookup in Semantic Cache** → **Evaluate JavaScript Cache** → **Check Cache Hit**."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
